[E] 时钟：now 早于观测时刻（漏传 now / 时钟源不一致）
==============================================================================

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  a) 正确传 now=100.5（证据新鲜）:
  success  = True
  detail   = ball -> basket 判定成立（距离 0.0cm / 阈值 11.7cm）
  relation = {'type': 'inside', 'distance_cm': 0.0, 'threshold_cm': 11.7, 'satisfied': True, 'before_distance_cm': 108.17, 'before_satisfied': False}
  target   = before:ball_900 after:ball_900
  reasons  = []
  caveats  = ['no_height_evidence', 'heuristic_confidence']

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  b) 正确传 now=130.0（证据已 30 秒未刷新）:
  success  = False
  detail   = ball -> basket 判定不成立（距离 0.0cm / 阈值 11.7cm）：证据过旧，视觉确认不可靠
  relation = {'type': 'inside', 'distance_cm': 0.0, 'threshold_cm': 11.7, 'satisfied': True, 'before_distance_cm': 108.17, 'before_satisfied': False}
  target   = before:ball_900 after:ball_900
  reasons  = ['stale_evidence']
  caveats  = ['no_height_evidence', 'heuristic_confidence']

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  c) 调用方漏传 now（JudgeRequest.now 默认 0.0）:
  success  = False
  detail   = ball -> basket 判定不成立（距离 0.0cm / 阈值 11.7cm）：now 早于观测时刻，调用方时钟与观测时钟不一致，判定作废
  relation = {'type': 'inside', 'distance_cm': 0.0, 'threshold_cm': 11.7, 'satisfied': True, 'before_distance_cm': 108.17, 'before_satisfied': False}
  target   = before:ball_900 after:ball_900
  reasons  = ['clock_skew']
  caveats  = ['no_height_evidence', 'heuristic_confidence']

  age() 不再把负数夹成 0，c) 被 clock_skew 拦下。
  修复前 c) 的 staleness 恒为 0.0，30 秒前的快照被当作实时视觉确认。

>>> [E] PASS — 应判 True，实判 True —— 新鲜->成立；陈旧->stale_evidence；时钟不一致->clock_skew

