[G] 单帧误检：桶里冒出一帧高分反光，只出现这一帧
==============================================================================
  after:
    ball_001     name=ball    conf=0.850 state=confirmed pos=(+0.300,+1.000) age=+0.0s
    basket_002   name=basket  conf=0.920 state=confirmed pos=(-0.600,+1.600) age=+0.0s
    ball_003     name=ball    conf=0.970 state=tentative pos=(-0.610,+1.590) age=+0.0s
  success  = False
  detail   = ball -> basket 判定不成立（距离 108.17cm / 阈值 11.7cm）：几何关系不成立
  relation = {'type': 'inside', 'distance_cm': 108.17, 'threshold_cm': 11.7, 'satisfied': False, 'before_distance_cm': 108.17, 'before_satisfied': False}
  target   = before:ball_001 after:ball_001
  reasons  = ['geometry_not_satisfied']
  caveats  = ['no_height_evidence', 'heuristic_confidence']

  判定主语由 before 锁定 -> 看的是桌上那个球，它没动 -> 失败。
  即使调用方不给 id，误检轨迹是 TENTATIVE（hit_count=1 < confirm_hits=3），
  也会被 unconfirmed_track 挡住 —— 状态机现在真的参与判定了。
  不给 id 时：success=False reasons=['ambiguous_target', 'geometry_not_satisfied']

>>> [G] PASS — 应判 False，实判 False —— 单帧误检（['ball_003']）不再构成视觉确认

